    "q-38004": {
      "dom_id": "step-q38004",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "The standard matrix $T$ of a linear transformation $T$ and the vector $b\\in {R}^{3}$ are given below. Determine if there exists a vector $x\\in {R}^{3}$ such that $T(x)=b.$\nIn the affirmative case, find the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2},$ where ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ are the components of $x.$  \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -6 & 8 & -7 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Since $T$ is the standard matix of $T,$ we have $\\text{Im}(T)=\\text{Col}(T).$ In order to determine whether $b$ lies in $\\text{Im}(T),$ we need to check if the equation $Tx=b$ is consistent. \n\nSo, we find the row echelon form of the augmented matrix $[T\\,|\\,b],$ as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T\\,|\\,b] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 4 & -10 \\\\ -6 & 8 & -7 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5 & 1\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 4 & -10 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5 & -27 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5 & 1\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 4 & -10 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 5 & -27 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 28\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get the false statement $0=28.$ Therefore, the system is inconsistent, and we conclude that  $b\\notin \\text{Im}(T).$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-38004-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-1",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"150\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-38004-b",
