>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟹</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>As a result, the general solution is given by \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"281\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-v class=\"mjx-c5B\" style=\"height: 3.8em; vertical-align: -1.65em;\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 3.231em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-top: 0.2em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-scr